  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of Danish Development Cooperation with Tanzania 1962-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An evaluation assessing Denmark&#x2019;s longest-standing development cooperation partnership, which will investigate and identify whether, how and for whom Danish development cooperation has contributed to change in Tanzania, and explore the implications of different types of partnerships established over time.
The main objective is to assess Denmark&#x2019;s longest-standing development cooperation partnership, with emphasis on the contribution to change (accountability), and identify relevant lessons learned.</narrative>
  </description>
